Package: circadiandynamics
Type: Package
Title: Period and Rhythm Analysis of Timeseries Data
Version: 4.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Eddie", "Pérez Claudio", email = "eddieperezclaudio@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Manuel", "Guiannoni-Guzmán", role = "aut"),
    person("Jonathan", "Alemán", role = "aut"),
    person("José L.", "Agosto-Rivera", role = "aut"))
Description:
    Finds the period of univariate and multivariate timeseries (datetime) data by window.
    It will iterate over each window and find any changes in the period. Also fits a COSINOR
    function to the data.
